{"about_the_game":"Sephiria is a top-down action rogue-lite game with pixel graphics.<br><br>Players take on the role of a rabbit in the village at the top of the tower and must change the fate of the tower from destruction.<br><br>Go down the tower, meet various animals, and collect various artifacts and tablets to become stronger.<br><br>That is the only way to prevent destruction.<br><br><br><br>[Main Features]<br><br>- Top-down action game with fast and intuitive controls: Sweep and attack many enemies, block their attacks, and immerse yourself in a fast-paced action game.<br><br>- Cute pixel graphics: Explore a world made up of beautiful pixel art.<br><br>- Your own build: Become stronger by collecting artifacts that provide special effects just by acquiring them and tablets that enhance the effects of adjacent artifacts.<br><br>- Various interactive elements: Talk, ask for favors, and trade with the animals you meet in the game. They can be allies or enemies.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stronghold Exploration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/ff167add61ebe6b9152c81e1ccea8d8ba97cd72f.jpg"},{"name":"Sky of the Roofless Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/7bc303be74f026935a52ac814b847c87c0d9a5a0.jpg"},{"name":"This Is Not Stalking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/de217db3782a7d5b90a599978c136d5e01e411c7.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightened Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/a732c660f7612ea92b1aa47ddad5358da5a87e34.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Bombs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/6fd88afad49fc5b45ff37f0b193860bc13ca079f.jpg"},{"name":"Hunting Duel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436940/ab559511017b498b91a2412ad9504557d9ea574e.jpg"},{"name":"Qliphoth C